                %li
                  %p
                    %a{:href => "https://www.ias.edu/sns/quantum-information-workshop-2021"} IAS Workshop on Quantum Information and Spacetime, December 6-8, 2021
            %li
              %p
                %em> It from Qubit
                , Simons Collaboration on Quantum Fields, Gravity, and Information &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.simonsfoundation.org/2022/03/08/it-from-qubit-and-the-gravity-of-a-quantum-universe/"}> webpage
                ,
